{"id":"word:hebrew:H905","type":"word","title":"בַּד","subtitle":"H905 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"properly, separation ; by implication, a part of the body, branch of a tree, bar for carrying; figuratively, chief of a city; especially (with prepositional prefix) as an adverb, apart , only , besides","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to בַּד (H905) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-m.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 202 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"בַּד (bad) means properly, separation ; by implication, a part of the body, branch of a tree, bar for carrying; figuratively, chief of a city; especially (with prepositional prefix) as an adverb, apart , only , besides First listed occurrence: 1Chr 3 9."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"בַּד","transliteration":"bad","pronunciation":"bad","strong":"H905","lemmaId":"hebrew:H905","partOfSpeech":"n-m","forms":["מִ/לְּ/בַד֙","לְ/בַדּֽ/וֹ","לְ/בַדּ֔/וֹ","בַּדָּ֖י/ו","לְ/בַדּ֖/וֹ"],"morphs":[["HR/Ncmsc/Sp3ms",37],["HR/Ncmsa",34],["HR/R/Ncmsc",28],["HR/Ncmsc/Sp2ms",17],["HR/Ncmsc/Sp1cs",16],["HNcmpc/Sp3ms",15],["HTd/Ncmpa",15],["HR/Ncmsc/Sp3mp",10],["HR/Ncmsc/Sp3fs",5],["HNcmpc",5]]},"definitions":{"short":"properly, separation ; by implication, a part of the body, branch of a tree, bar for carrying; figuratively, chief of a city; especially (with prepositional prefix) as an adverb, apart , only , besides","usage":"alone, apart, bar, besides, branch, by self, of each alike, except, only, part, staff, strength.","full":"H905. bad II, III. בַּד see below I, II. בדד . II. בָּ֑ד בַּד, noun masculine separation , concrete part (, portion ) — suffix (always with לְ ) לְבַדּוֺ לְבַדִּי, etc., 3 feminine plural Gen 21:28 לְבַדְּהֶן , 21:29 לְבַדָּ֫נָה ; — 1 with לְ , only in singular, לְבַד properly in a state of (see below לְ ) separation, alone, by itself (French à part ). a. Exod 26:9 (= 36:16 ) five curtains לְבַד by themselves , and six curtains לְבַד by themselves , Judg 7:5 him shalt thou set לבד apart , Zech 12:12-14 . b. with suffix (89 t.) to express the idea of by oneself, alone (properly in his, thy, my separation ), Gen 2:18 it is not good for man to be לְבַדּוֺ alone , 21:28 and A. set the seven lambs לְבַדְּהֶן by themselves (literally in their separation), 32:17 ; 43:32 ; 2Sam 10:8 ; Isa 5:8 ; Gen 42:38 לְבַדּוֺ הוּא he alone , Exod 18:14 לְבַדְּךָ אַתָּה thou alone , Num 11:14 לְבַדִּי אָנֹכִי I alone , 1Kin 19:10 , 14 ; Deut 8:3 not upon bread alone , 29:13 ; 2Sam 13:32 ; 18:24 ; Isa 44:24 ; 49:21 ; 63:3 +; after an oblique case, as a dative Exod 22:19 ; Judg 3:20 ; Psa 51:6 לְבַדְּךָ לְךָ against thee alone have I sinned; a Genitive 71:16 I will make mention of לְבֶַדּךָ׃ צִדְקָֽתְךָ the righteousness of thee alone . c. as adverb of limitation, Isa 26:13 only through thee do we celebrate thy name, Eccl 7:29 . d. followed by מִן it becomes a preposition, apart from, besides , Exod 12:37 ; Num 29:39 ; Deut 3:5 ; 18:8 (read מִמְּכָרָיו with ᵑ7 ᵑ6 ᵐ5 Aq Ew Di) Judg 8:26 ; 20:15 and elsewhere (15 t.); once, Ezra 1:6 , with עַל instead of מִן . e. מִלְּבַד 33 (probably inverted for מִן לְבַד besides ) (chiefly P and late): Gen 26:1 ; 46:26 ; Lev 9:17 ; 23:38 (4 t.) Num 5:8 ; 6:21 ; Numbers 17:14 12 t. 28-29; Deuteronomy 28:69; Josh 22:29 ; 1Kin 10:13 ; 1Chr 3:9 ; 2Chr 9:12 ; 17:19 ; 31:16 ; Ezra 2:65 = Neh 7:67 ; Dan 11:4 . With suffix Deut 4:35 מִלְּבַדּוֺ עוֺד אֵין there is none else besides him (compare מִבַּלְעָדַי Isa 45:21 ). 2 concrete part Exod 30:34 (P) יִהְיֶה בְּבַד בַּד part for (i.e. like; compare בְּ III. 3. end) part shall it be. 3 בַּדִּים parts , specifically extended from something , i.e. ( a ) of a body, members, limbs Job 18:13 (of man), 41:4 (of crocodile); ( b ) of a vine, rods or shoots Ezek 17:6 ; 19:14 ; ( c ) of poles or staves used for carrying the ark Exod 25:13-14 , 15 ; 35:12 ; 37:4-5 , 39:35 ; 40:20 ; Num 4:6 ; 1Kin 8:7-8 , (twice in verse) (= 2Chr 5:8-9 , (twice in verse)), or table of shewbread Exod 25:27-28 , 35:13 ; 37:14-15 , Num 4:8 , or altar of B. O. Exod 27:6 (twice in verse); 27:7 (twice in verse); 35:16 ; 38:5-6 , 7 ; 39:39 ; Num 4:14 , or altar of incense Exod 30:4-5 , 35:15 ; 37:27-28 , Num 4:11 ; ( d ) more Generally bars (of fortress) Hosea 11:6 , (of a gate) Job 17:16 figurative שְׁאֹל בַּדֵּי (see Isa 38:10 ). ** Job 17:16 read הַעִמָּדִי (for בַּדֵּי ) ᵐ5 Du Dr, with נֵחָ֑ת in v b (for נָחַ֑ת ).","rootNote":"from 909 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 3 9","keyReferences":["1Chr 3 9","1Chr 19 9","1Kgs 5 3","1Kgs 5 30","1Kgs 8 7","1Kgs 8 8","1Kgs 8 8","1Kgs 8 39"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":202,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 3 9","book":"1Chr","chapter":3,"verse":9,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מִ/לְּ/בַ֥ד","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/R/Ncmsc"},{"reference":"1Chr 19 9","book":"1Chr","chapter":19,"verse":9,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לְ/בַדָּ֖/ם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncmsc/Sp3mp"},{"reference":"1Kgs 5 3","book":"1Kgs","chapter":5,"verse":3,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לְ֠/בַד","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 5 30","book":"1Kgs","chapter":5,"verse":30,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לְ֠/בַד","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 8 7","book":"1Kgs","chapter":8,"verse":7,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בַּדָּ֖י/ו","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmpc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"1Kgs 8 8","book":"1Kgs","chapter":8,"verse":8,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/בַּדִּים֒","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncmpa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 8 8","book":"1Kgs","chapter":8,"verse":8,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/בַּדִּ֤ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncmpa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 8 39","book":"1Kgs","chapter":8,"verse":39,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לְ/בַדְּ/ךָ֔","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncmsc/Sp2ms"},